    <bpmn:startEvent id="START" name="Demand raised on the Single Front Door"/>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_01" name="IN-01 Complete Required Demand Information">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Demand type, impacted markets, sponsor, required delivery date, funding information, existing WBS where applicable, dependencies, business benefits, IT/security impact and supporting documents; only the fields the requester guide marks mandatory are mandatory. Team: Requestor. Tool: Networks Single Front Door (Pega). Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Networks Demand Front Door Requester User Guide (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_02" name="IN-02 Submit Demand through Networks Single Front Door">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. The requestor raises the demand on the Single Front Door (G0). Team: Requestor. Tool: Networks Single Front Door (Pega). Output: G0. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, step 1; Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 34</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_04" name="IN-04 DAM Reviews Submission Completeness">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. The DAM reviews whether the submission is complete. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Status: C2. Evidence: C2. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, step 2 (DAM triage); Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 34</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_18" name="Demand complete?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_05" name="IN-05 DAM Initial Triage and Classification">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. The DAM performs initial triage and classification of the demand. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, step 2; Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 34</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_06" name="IN-06 Identify Impacted Network Functions">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. The DAM identifies the impacted Network Functions. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Status: C2. Evidence: C2. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, step 4a; Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 34</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_19" name="Cross-functional?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_07" name="IN-07 Cross-functional Handshake">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Other NW Function PS handshake with the DAM, where the demand is cross-functional. Team: NW Vertical Function SPOC. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, step 3b and &quot;Cross functional?&quot; gateway</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.01.01" name="FA.01.01 Accept Request and Initiate EDM Allocation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Accept the request and initiate EDM allocation. Team: Market Delivery Manager (MDM). Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI, FA.01.01</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.01.02" name="FA.01.02 EDM Appointment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Appoint the Engineering Delivery Manager. Team: Market Delivery Manager (MDM). Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI, FA.01.02</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.02.01" name="FA.02.01 Team and Solution Authority Allocation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Allocate the delivery team and the Solution Authority. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI, FA.02.01</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_01" name="IA-01 Cross-functional Impact Assessment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. NW vertical teams and other NW functions perform the impact assessment (G0 to G1). Team: Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, steps 5a, 5b and 5c</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_02" name="IA-02 Assess Network and IT Impacts">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Assess network impacts and IT impacts where IT dependencies exist. Team: IT. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, step 5d</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_03" name="IA-03 Develop HLD and Feasibility Information">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Coordinate high-level design and feasibility information from all NW verticals, including solution design definition. Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, steps 5e, 7a and 7b</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.03.xx" name="FA.03.xx Security, Privacy, Resilience and Operations Impact">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Security, privacy, resilience and operations-impact activities, where applicable. Team: Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI, FA.03</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.04.xx" name="FA.04.xx Feasibility Analysis and Cost Estimation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Feasibility analysis and cost estimation. Team: Solution Authority. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI, FA.04</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_04" name="IA-04 Estimate Resources">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Estimate delivery resources (cost estimation sits in FA.04). Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: WFM. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: No independent page associated</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_05" name="IA-05 Check Budget Availability and Priority">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Check budget availability and priority with the market sponsor and NW budget availability with NSE Planning. Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 118, steps 7a/7b and 8a/8b</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_06" name="IA-06 Consolidate Impact Assessments">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Consolidate the impact assessments. Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 119, steps 9a/10b</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_07" name="IA-07 Prepare Demand Board Submission">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Prepare the submission to the Demand Board (in-year demand). Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Output: G2 submission. Status: C2. Evidence: C2. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 119, steps 9a/10b</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DM_15" name="DM-15 Demand Board Decision">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 3. The Demand Board reviews the consolidated impact assessment and decides. Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Output: Approval or rejection. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 119, &quot;Demand Board Approval&quot;; Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 34</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_20" name="Demand Board approved?"/>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="NPRB_check" name="Do the documented NPRB entry criteria apply?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DM_19" name="DM-19 NPRB Route">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 3. NPRB manages project and funding mobilisation for the in-year project, only where its documented entry criteria apply. Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Output: NPRB decision. Status: V. Evidence: V. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 119, steps 12a/12b; entry criteria not confirmed</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Market_check" name="Does the market procedure require market governance?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DM_24" name="DM-24 Market Governance Route">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 3. Follow the market's documented governance route, only where the applicable market procedure requires it. Team: Market governance (per market). Tool: . Status: V. Evidence: V. Source: Market procedure to identify</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Plan_change" name="Does the approved demand require an in-year plan change?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DM_17" name="DM-17 NCAR In-year Change Route">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 3. NCAR governs approval of changes to the in-year plan, including agreement on prioritisation; the approved plan or rolling forecast is then updated where required. Team: Demand Governance Team. Tool: . Output: NCAR decision. Status: V. Evidence: V. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 119, steps 11a/11b; thresholds not confirmed</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="OM_route" name="Does the documented Order Management route apply?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DM_16" name="DM-16 DAM Informs Requestor of Rejection">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 3. The DAM informs the requestor about the rejection. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: . Output: Requestor informed. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: Booklet_NPDDT_v10.11 slide 119, step 10bis</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_01" name="RF-01 In-year Demand Collection">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. In-year demand collection from markets, business functions and VF NW functions. Team: Engagement Executives / NW Function Budget SPOC. Tool: . Output: Spend Approval Board. Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_02" name="RF-02 Assure and Evaluate New Demand">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Assurance and evaluation of the new demand against the strategy. Team: Engagement Executives / NW Function Budget SPOC. Tool: . Output: Demand Approval Board. Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_03" name="RF-03 Recommend Embedding New Demand">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Provide recommendations to embed new demands in the plan, if agreed. Team: Engagement Executives / NW Function Budget SPOC. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_04" name="RF-04 Evaluate Alternatives on Plan Priorities">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Evaluate alternatives on the plan priorities to embed new demand. Team: Engagement Executives / NW Function Budget SPOC. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_05" name="RF-05 Review and Agree Plan Changes">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Review and agree on plan changes. Team: NW Director &amp; NW Leadership Team / Engagement Executives. Tool: . Output: Governance meeting. Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_21" name="Plan changes agreed at LT + CNO?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_06" name="RF-06 Updated Plan Submitted to Local Market">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Updated plan submitted to Local Market. Team: CNO / Engagement Executives. Tool: . Output: NCAR. Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_07" name="RF-07 Consultation with Local ExCo">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Consultation with Local ExCo. Team: Market CEO / NW Function Budget SPOC. Tool: . Output: Plan discussion with Local ExCo. Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_22" name="Changes agreed (NW Function Budget SPOC)?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_08" name="RF-08 Inform Vertical Directors and NW Director">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Inform vertical directors and NW Director. Team: NW Director &amp; NW Leadership Team. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RF_09" name="RF-09 Submit Plan (incl. KPIs) to Finance">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 4. Final submission of the plan, including KPIs, to Finance. Team: Demand &amp; Planning. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_23" name="Does the documented Order Management route apply?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_01" name="OM-01 Create or Update Order in Networks Front Door">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Create or update the order in the Networks Front Door. Team: Order Requester. Tool: Networks Front Door (Pega). Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 6, step 1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_02" name="OM-02 Submit Order">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Submit the order in Pega. Team: Order Requester. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 6, step 1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_03" name="OM-03 Order Assurance">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. The Networks Order Manager reviews the submission and completes order assurance. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 6, step 2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_24" name="Internal or external order?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_04" name="OM-04 Validate Commercial and Contractual Evidence">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. External: validate signed contract details, funding, agreed SLAs, scope and volumes of the contract. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 6, step 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_05" name="OM-05 Obtain WBS Information (External)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. WBS codes are provided by IP&amp;H, supported by the Network Market Planner and Group Network Finance. Team: Networks Order Manager / IP&amp;H. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 9</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_06" name="OM-06 Validate Business Case and Budget Evidence">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Internal: confirm an approved business case is attached and the work is approved by local market governance with allocated budget. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 6, step 4</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_07" name="OM-07 Identify WBS Information from Business Case (Internal)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. WBS codes are detailed in the business case. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 9</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_08" name="OM-08 Decompose Order into Service Elements">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Decompose the order and record it in Pega. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 6</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_09" name="OM-09 Route Elements to Impacted Functions">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Recording the order in Pega routes each service element to the impacted functions. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 6</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_10" name="OM-10 Functions Validate Requirements">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Each impacted function reviews the order against the quotation (volume, resources, scheduling). Team: Networks Function SME. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 7</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_11" name="OM-11 Confirm Resource Commitments">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Secure resources for delivery (hard book) and commit resources and schedule. Team: Networks Function SME. Tool: WFM. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 7</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_12" name="OM-12 Record Functional Acceptance in Pega">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Each impacted function records its functional acceptance in Pega. Team: Networks Function SME. Tool: Pega. Output: Functional acceptance. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 8</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_25" name="Have all required functions accepted?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_13" name="OM-13 Confirm Overall Order Acceptance">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. The Networks Order Manager confirms overall order acceptance in Pega. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Output: Order accepted. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 8</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_14" name="OM-14 Complete WBS and Budget Arrangements">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. Complete the applicable WBS and budget arrangements through the shared SAP/WBS and budget setup subprocess. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, boxes 9 and 10</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_15" name="OM-15 Move Accepted Order to Delivery Queue">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. The accepted order moves to the delivery queue for handover to delivery. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="OM_16" name="OM-16 Delivery Manager Picks Up Order">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 5. The Delivery Manager picks up the order, confirms SoWs, requests a PO if applicable and updates delivery tracking in Pega. Team: Delivery Manager. Tool: Pega. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 10</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="MB_01" name="MB-01 Submit Mobilisation Request">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Submit the mobilisation request (PPM tool, email or SharePoint form, depending on the market). Team: Requester for Mobilisation. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 12, step 1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_26" name="Can mobilisation proceed directly from the approved plan?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="MB_03" name="MB-03 Prepare or Refresh Approval Documentation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Manage updates to the mobilisation documentation and include stakeholder feedback. Team: Requester for Mobilisation. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 12, steps 2 and 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_27" name="Does the SAB process apply?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="SAB_1" name="SAB-1 Request Intake">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Capture, classify and validate the spend request. Team: SAB Governance. Tool: . Output: Validated request. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slides 10 and 11, stage 1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="SAB_2" name="SAB-2 Quality Check">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Assess submission quality and correct exceptions. Team: SAB Governance. Tool: . Output: Quality-cleared submission. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slides 10 and 11, stage 2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="SAB_3" name="SAB-3 SAB Governance">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Prepare the governance pack and assess the SAB outcome. Team: SAB Governance. Tool: . Output: Governance decision. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slides 10 and 11, stage 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="SAB_4" name="SAB-4 Spend Approval">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Route, approve, record and communicate the decision. Team: SAB Governance. Tool: . Output: Approved spend request. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slides 10 and 11, stage 4</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="SAB_5" name="SAB-5 Fulfilment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Allocate or transfer budget and close the case; budget loading itself sits in the shared SAP/WBS subprocess. Team: SAB Governance. Tool: . Output: Budget fulfilled. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slides 10 and 11, stage 5</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="MB_04" name="MB-04 Review and Decide (Applicable Approval Process)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Decision makers review the request; decision authority per market RAPID; G2 approval if applicable. Team: Decision Makers (market RAPID). Tool: . Output: Decision. Status: V. Evidence: V. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 12, step 7 and Local Market Adaptation 4</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_28" name="Approved?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="MB_02" name="MB-02 Validate Existing Justification in Plan">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Validate plan details, justification and financial elements in the latest approved plan. Team: Market Planning Lead / Market Finance Lead. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 12, steps 4a and 4b</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="MB_05" name="MB-05 Record and Communicate Decision">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Record decisions and actions in the mobilisation tracker and communicate them. Team: Governance SPOC &amp; Market Finance Lead. Tool: Mobilisation tracker. Output: Decision recorded. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 12, steps 8 and 9</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_29" name="Is SAP/WBS or budget setup required?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="MB_06" name="MB-06 Initiate Required Financial Setup">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 6. Initiate the required financial setup through the shared SAP/WBS and budget setup subprocess. Team: Market Finance Lead. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 12, step 10</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Mob_delivery_route" name="Delivery route?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_01" name="DLM-01 Delivery Team Allocation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Delivery team allocation. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Output: G2. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_02" name="DLM-02 Coordinate Vendors Engagement">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Coordinate vendors engagement. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_03" name="DLM-03 Project Delivery Kick-off">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Project delivery kick-off with all verticals. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_04" name="DLM-04 High-Level Design Fine-tuning">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Coordinate verticals and security team for high-level design fine-tuning. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM) / Solution Authority. Tool: . Output: Fine-tuned high-level design. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_05" name="DLM-05 Detailed Project Management Plan">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Detailed project management plan. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_06" name="DLM-06 Project Plan Sign-off">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Detailed project management plan sign-off. Team: Market Delivery Manager (MDM). Tool: . Output: Detailed project management plan. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_07" name="DLM-07 Vendor POs for LLD, Build and Test">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Vendors POs issuing for LLD, build and test. Team: Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_08" name="DLM-08 LLD and E2E Test Plan Definition">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Coordinate verticals and security team for LLD and test plan definition; low-level design; E2E test plan definition. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM) / Team in NSE Vertical / Infrastructure Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Output: Low-level design document; E2E test plan. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_09" name="DLM-09 Geo-redundancy Specifications">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. Provide detailed geo-redundancy specifications. Team: Solution Authority. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_10" name="DLM-10 LLD and E2E Test Plan Sign-off">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 7. LLD and E2E test plan sign-off. Team: EIM. Tool: . Output: G3. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_30" name="G3 approved?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_11" name="DLM-11 Geo-redundancy and Privacy Handover">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Geo-redundancy and privacy specifications handover to operations. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_12" name="DLM-12 Implementation Plan Definition">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Implementation plan definition. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM) / Solution Authority / Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_13" name="DLM-13 Lab Delivery and Testing">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Coordinate verticals for lab delivery and testing; lab delivery; lab testing. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM) / Team in NSE Vertical / Infrastructure Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Output: Lab test report; G4. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_31" name="G4 lab tests passed?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_14" name="DLM-14 Live Delivery and Testing">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Coordinate verticals for live delivery and testing; live delivery; live testing; EDM ensures privacy and security remedial actions. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM) / Team in NSE Vertical / Infrastructure Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Output: Live test report. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_15" name="DLM-15 FOA + UAT Sign-off">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. First Office Application and User Acceptance Test sign-off. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM) / Local Cross Functions. Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_16" name="DLM-16 Go-live">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Go-live. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_32" name="G5 approved?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_17" name="DLM-17 Final Handover to Operations">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Final handover to operations. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_18" name="DLM-18 Project Closing and Completion Documentation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. Project closing: completion documentation and delivery record (G6 completion). Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Output: G6 completion. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="DLM_19" name="DLM-19 EDM PM Performance Review">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 8. EDM project manager performance review. Team: Market Delivery Manager (MDM). Tool: . Output: Project closure. Status: C2. Evidence: C2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_01" name="WB-01 Confirm Accepted Order">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. The Networks Order Manager communicates that the WBS can be created. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_02" name="WB-02 Review Booked Resources and Countries">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Review booked resources to confirm the resource-country requirements; a separate WBS is needed per country. Team: Service Owner. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, box 1</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_03" name="WB-03 Prepare SAP MDG Template">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Prepare the MDG template for WBS creation, except the project code (NMP for local market delivery; Service Owner for central NSE delivery). Team: Network Market Planning (NMP). Tool: Excel MDG template. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, box 2</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_04" name="WB-04 Finalise Template and Check Existing Project">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. IP&amp;H finalises the template with the project code and checks whether an SAP project already exists. Team: IP&amp;H. Tool: Excel MDG template. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, boxes 2 and 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_33" name="Does an SAP project already exist?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_05" name="WB-05 New Project Route">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Create a new project and WBS(s) to cover all resource locations. Team: IP&amp;H. Tool: SAP MDG. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, box 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_06" name="WB-06 Existing Project Route">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. If required, create new WBS(s) for an additional resource location. Team: IP&amp;H. Tool: SAP MDG. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, box 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_07" name="WB-07 Upload Template into SAP MDG">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Upload the template into SAP MDG. Team: IP&amp;H. Tool: SAP MDG. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, box 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_08" name="WB-08 Monitor Creation and Update WBS Records">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Monitor WBS creation and update the WBS database and Time Buddy records. Team: IP&amp;H. Tool: WBS database / Time Buddy. Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 8, box 3</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_09" name="WB-09 Share WBS Codes with Delivery Stakeholders">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Share the WBS codes with delivery and timesheet teams. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: . Status: C1. Evidence: C1. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 9; slide 8, box 4</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_10" name="WB-10 Verify Approved Funding and Spend Authority">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. WBS structure established; approved budget allocation and spend authority verified separately. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: No independent page associated</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_34" name="CAPEX budget loading required?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_11" name="WB-11 Load Budget on Project CAPEX WBS">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Where required, Finance FDS and the offshore team load budget on the Project CAPEX WBS, coordinated by the Networks Order Manager. Team: Finance FDS / offshore team. Tool: SAP. Status: V. Evidence: V. Source: HVS 4 and 5 MOC v0.1 slide 7, box 9 (&quot;if required&quot;)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="WB_12" name="WB-12 Confirm Financial Readiness">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 9. Confirm financial readiness for delivery. Team: Networks Order Manager. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: No independent page associated</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_01" name="PR-01 Confirm Procurement Requirement">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Confirm that supplier procurement is required. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Procure to Pay Standard (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_02" name="PR-02 Confirm Supplier Quotation and Approved Scope">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Confirm the supplier quotation and approved scope. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Procure to Pay Standard (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_35" name="Shopping cart required?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_03" name="PR-03 Raise Shopping Cart">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Raise the shopping cart where required. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_04" name="PR-04 Obtain Shopping Cart Approval">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Obtain shopping cart approval. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_05" name="PR-05 Generate Purchase Order">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Generate the purchase order. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: SAP / EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_06" name="PR-06 Issue PO to Supplier">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Issue the purchase order to the supplier. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: SAP / EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_07" name="PR-07 Supplier Delivers Goods or Services">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. The supplier delivers the goods or services. Team: Supplier. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="PR_08" name="PR-08 Confirm Delivery or Service Acceptance">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 10. Confirm delivery or service acceptance. Team: Procurement / Commercial Owner to Confirm. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_01" name="FE-01 Validate Delivery">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. The authorised receiver validates the delivered goods or services. Team: Authorised Receiver. Tool: EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_02" name="FE-02 Record Goods Receipt">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Record the goods receipt according to the applicable procedure. Team: Authorised Receiver. Tool: EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: Goods Receipting (GRN) Process (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_03" name="FE-03 Receive Supplier Invoice">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Receive the supplier invoice. Team: Finance / Procurement Role to Confirm. Tool: Invoice process. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: FM.02.03.04.02 Match Invoice to Purchase Order (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Matching_route" name="Which matching procedure applies?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_04" name="FE-04 Two-way Match">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Match the invoice against the PO, for the transactions the procedure specifies. Team: Finance / Procurement Role to Confirm. Tool: SAP / EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: FM.02.03.04.02 Match Invoice to Purchase Order (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_05" name="FE-05 Three-way Match">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Match the invoice, PO and GRN, for the applicable transactions. Team: Finance / Procurement Role to Confirm. Tool: SAP / EVO. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: FM.02.03.04.02 Match Invoice to Purchase Order (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Match_result" name="Match successful?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_06" name="FE-06 Resolve Exception">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Resolve the exception through the applicable resolution procedure, then return to matching. Team: Finance / Procurement Role to Confirm. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: FM.02.03.04.02 Match Invoice to Purchase Order (page reference to associate before promotion)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_07" name="FE-07 Process Payment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Payment follows the applicable authorisation. Team: Finance / Procurement Role to Confirm. Tool: SAP. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: No independent page associated</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FE_08" name="FE-08 Update Actuals and Commitments">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 11. Update financial actuals and commitments. Team: Finance / Procurement Role to Confirm. Tool: SAP. Status: I. Evidence: I. Source: No independent page associated</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RG_01" name="RG-01 Month Pre-closure">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 12. Run the month pre-closure (child subprocess D1). Team: NMP. Tool: SAP. Status: I. Evidence: I</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RG_02" name="RG-02 Month Closure">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 12. Run the month closure (child subprocess D2). Team: NMP. Tool: SAP. Status: I. Evidence: I</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RG_03" name="RG-03 Forecast Update">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 12. Reflect the latest financial position in the forecast. Team: Finance &amp; Planning. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="RG_04" name="RG-04 Actuals and Commitments Review">
