      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 13. Analyse and request forecast for the way each department will close the month; verticals supply full reasons for any plan deviation with mitigation actions. Team: Vertical SPOCs. Tool: . Status: I. Evidence: I</bpmn:documentation>
